<dialog id="wash-guide" aria-labelledby="wash-guide-title"><div class="dialog-body"><button type="button" class="close" aria-label="Close">×</button><p class="eyebrow">Wash-day guide</p><h2 id="wash-guide-title">Start with what works.</h2><ol><li>Cleanse with your usual wash-day products, then rinse.</li><li>Apply your usual conditioner according to its label. If you add steam, follow the steamer manual.</li><li>Rinse as directed and dry with the tool that suits your finish.</li></ol><button class="text-link" type="button" data-open="curl-guide">Explore curl patterns ↗</button></div></dialog>
  <dialog id="curl-guide" aria-labelledby="curl-guide-title"><div class="dialog-body"><button type="button" class="close" aria-label="Close">×</button><p class="eyebrow">Curl guide</p><h2 id="curl-guide-title">Find your pattern.</h2><p>Look at how several sections of your hair sit once they’ve air-dried. It’s common to see more than one pattern on the same head.</p><dl class="curl-types"><dt>Waves</dt><dd>Loose bends or S-shaped strands. Try gentle drying to keep the wave in place.</dd><dt>Curls</dt><dd>Visible spirals or ringlets. Try drying with a diffuser if you want to disturb the curl shape less.</dd><dt>Coils</dt><dd>Tight loops or zigzags. Try working in sections to make conditioning and styling easier.</dd></dl><button class="text-link" type="button" data-open="builder">Build a wash-day routine ↗</button></div></dialog>
  <dialog id="steam-guide" aria-labelledby="steam-guide-title"><div class="dialog-body"><button type="button" class="close" aria-label="Close">×</button><p class="eyebrow">Steam care 101</p><h2 id="steam-guide-title">Where steam fits in.</h2><p>Use the hood during your conditioning step. Set up the steamer according to its manual, follow product directions, then finish with your usual rinse and styling routine.</p><p>The facial attachment is a separate setup. Follow the manual when switching between the hood and facial attachment.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products/hair-steamer-kingsteam-2-in-1-ozone-facial-steamer-design-for-personal-care-use-at-home-or-salon-1">See the 2-in-1 steamer ↗</a></div></dialog>
  <dialog id="builder" aria-labelledby="builder-title"><div class="dialog-body"><button type="button" class="close" aria-label="Close">×</button><p class="eyebrow">Routine builder</p><h2 id="builder-title">How do you like to finish?</h2><div class="builder-options"><button class="button outline" type="button" data-finish="diffuser" aria-pressed="false">Diffuse my curls</button><button class="button outline" type="button" data-finish="hood" aria-pressed="false">Dry hands-free</button></div><div id="routine-result" class="routine-result" aria-live="polite"></div><template id="finish-diffuser"><p>Cleanse, condition, then finish with a diffuser to dry without rearranging your curl pattern.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products/dryer-diffuser-for-curly-hair">See the Dryer Diffuser ↗</a></template><template id="finish-hood"><p>Cleanse, condition, then sit under a hooded dryer for a hands-free finish.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products/hooded-hair-dryer">See the Hooded Hair Dryer ↗</a></template></div></dialog>
